# Keep line endings deterministic in every checkout.
#
# Without this file, `actions/checkout` on a windows-latest runner inherits git's
# Windows default of core.autocrlf=true and checks the tree out as CRLF, while
# Prettier's endOfLine default is "lf". The result is a CI-only failure: `npm run
# format:check` passes locally (the committed blobs and the local tree are both LF)
# and then reports every source file as unformatted on CI. Normalising here fixes
# it at the source rather than relaxing Prettier to endOfLine: "auto", which would
# merely hide mixed line endings instead of preventing them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never translate these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
